note.p:
Source: Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 64 D 560, CF 1475. Secret;
                    Limit Distribution. Drafted by Alexander Akalovsky of the Division of Language
                    Services, who served as U.S. interpreter; cleared by Merchant and Kohler; and
                    approved by the White House on October 12. Chairman Khrushchev visited the United States, September 15–27;
                    documentation concerning his visit, including the full text of this memorandum,
                    is printed in volume X, Part 1.
